      "frame": "KYE = Know Your Entity + Authority Finality™. KYE does not run agents; KYE governs whether an agent's action may become final.",
      "one_liner": "The runtime protocol that proves every consequential action was authorised, purpose-bound, evidenced, replayable and final before it changed the world.",
